<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλᾰχ-ῆ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in many places,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδήλωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					10
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδαμῇ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.3.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>in divers manners,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				468
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1626
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τε ἄλλῃ π. καὶ δὴ καὶ . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.87
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἄλλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					179c
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλάκις καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					538d
				</span></i>
			; <i>for many reasons,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.42
			</span></i>.</div>
